# DESIGN & AESTHETIC PRINCIPLES (Impeccable + Taste)

## Visual Restraint & Palette
- Strict monochrome base: Slate/Zinc neutral scale (`zinc-900` text, `zinc-100` dark-text).
- Single accent rule: Never use more than one brand accent color per view.
- No raw primary gradients or neon saturated borders.
- Replace heavy box shadows with subtle hairline borders (`border border-zinc-200/80` or `border-zinc-800`).

## Typography & Hierarchy
- Headings: Always apply tighter tracking (`tracking-tight`) and balanced weight (`font-semibold` or `font-medium`). Avoid arbitrary oversized headers.
- Body: Generous vertical leading (`leading-relaxed`), never pure `#000000` text.
- Form inputs: Clear label-to-input optical association (gap of 6px max, never floating labels with vague hierarchy).

## Layout & Spatial Rhythm
- Stick to strict 4px/8px spatial increments: `p-4`, `p-6`, `gap-6`. Avoid awkward 3px/5px ad-hoc margins.
- Generous whitespace: When in doubt, increase container padding (`p-6` over `p-3`).
- Border radii: Keep radii restrained (`rounded-lg` or `rounded-md`). Reserve full pills (`rounded-full`) exclusively for badges/tags.
